{"sourceUrl":"http://www.calt.com/n487/n2678/n2681/c2595115/content.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:38.193788+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://www.calt.com/n487/n2678/n2681/c2595115/content.html","html":"<div>\n<div><h1>中国运载火箭技术研究院招收2027年推免生（含直博生）相关要求</h1></div>\n<div>发布时间 : 2026-09-15 \r\n    来源 : 中国运载火箭技术研究院新闻中心</div>\n<div>\n<p><span><span>中国运载火箭技术研究院招收</span><span>2027</span><span>年</span></span></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><span>推免生（含直博生）相关要求</span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>中国运载火箭技术研究院现面向国内高校优秀本科生招收</span><span>2027</span><span>年推免生（含直博生），具体要求如下：</span></span></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><span>一、申请条件</span></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><span>申请者须同时具备以下条件：</span></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><span>1.</span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，热爱祖国，愿意为社会主义现代化建设服务，遵纪守法，品行端正，无违规违纪违法行为；</span></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><span>2.</span><span>身心健康，能够正常学习和生活；</span></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><span>3.</span><span>具有推免生资格的应届本科毕业生。</span></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><span>二、招生专业目录</span></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><b><span>1.</span></b><b><span>硕士招生专业目录</span></b></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><span><span>我院硕士各学科专业均可招收高校推免生，考生可点击下方链接查看《中国运载火箭技术研究院</span><span>2027</span><span>年硕士研究生招生专业目录》。</span></span></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><span>硕士招生专业目录查询链接：</span></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><span>http://www.calt.com/n487/n2678/n2681/c2594815/content.html</span></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><b><span>2.</span></b><b><span>直博生招生专业目录</span></b></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>表 中国运载火箭技术研究院<span>2027</span>年直博生招生专业目录</span></p>\n<div>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<td> <p><b><span>学科、专业名称（代码）</span></b></p> <p><b><span>研究方向</span></b></p> </td>\n<td> <p><b><span>拟招生</span></b></p> <p><b><span>人数</span></b></p> </td>\n<td> <p><b><span>招生方式</span></b></p> </td>\n<td> <p><b><span>培养单位</span></b></p> </td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td> <p><b><span>0825 </span></b><b><span>航空宇航科学与技术</span></b></p> </td>\n<td> <p><b><span>2</span></b></p> </td>\n<td> <p><b><span> </span></b></p> </td>\n<td> <p><b><span> </span></b></p> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td> <p><span>01</span><span>飞行器总体设计（控制总体）</span></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span>1</span></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span>直博</span></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span>研究发展中心</span></p> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td> <p><span>02</span><span>飞行器总体设计（飞发一体设计）</span></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span>1</span></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span>直博</span></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span>研究发展中心</span></p> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td> <p><b><span>0825 </span></b><b><span>航空宇航科学与技术</span></b></p> </td>\n<td> <p><b><span>1</span></b></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span> </span></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span> </span></p> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td> <p><span>01</span><span>飞行器总体设计</span></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span>1</span></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span>直博</span></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span>战术军贸事业部</span></p> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td> <p><b><span>0825 </span></b><b><span>航空宇航科学与技术</span></b></p> </td>\n<td> <p><b><span>1</span></b></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span> </span></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span> </span></p> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td> <p><span>01</span><span>动力系统总体设计</span></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span>1</span></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span>直博</span></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span>总体设计部</span></p> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td> <p><b><span>0825 </span></b><b><span>航空宇航科学与技术</span></b></p> </td>\n<td> <p><b><span>1</span></b></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span> </span></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span> </span></p> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td> <p><span>01</span><span>弹药工程</span></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span>1</span></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span>直博</span></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span>14</span><span>所</span></p> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td> <p><b><span>0804 </span></b><b><span>仪器科学与技术</span></b></p> </td>\n<td> <p><b><span>1</span></b></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span> </span></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span> </span></p> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td> <p><span>01</span><span>光电精密计量测试</span></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span>1</span></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span>直博</span></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span>102</span><span>所</span></p> </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p><span><br/> </span></p>\n<p><span>三、申请程序</span></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><b><span>1. </span></b><b><span>提交申请</span></b></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><span>申请者以电子邮件的形式向我院各研究生培养单位提交以下申请材料：</span></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）个人简历、学生证及有效居民身份证复印件。</span></span></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）国家英语四级（或六级）证书复印件，或相关外语等级考试合格证书复印件。</span></span></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）本科前三学年成绩单复印件（加盖学校成绩管理部门公章）。</span></span></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>4</span><span>）各类获奖证书复印件、学术论文、出版物或具有学术水平的工作成果复印件或证明。</span></span></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>5</span><span>）申请直博的学生还须提供至少</span><span>2</span><span>名所报考学科专业领域内的教授</span><span>(</span><span>或相当专业技术职务的专家</span><span>)</span><span>的书面推荐意见。</span></span></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><b><span>2.</span></b><b><span>材料审核</span></b></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><span>我院各研究生培养单位对学生提交的申请材料进行审核。</span></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><b><span>3.</span></b><b><span>组织复试</span></b></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><span>我院各研究生培养单位对审核通过的申请者进行复试，由培养单位通知考生复试时间、地点和具体要求。</span></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><b><span>4.</span></b><b><span>网上报名</span></b></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><span><span>复试通过的申请人应在教育部规定时间内登录“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（以下简称“推免服务系统”，</span><span>http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span><span>）进行网上报名（报名我院直博生的应在推免系统中选择填报“直博生”），系统开放时间为</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>21</span><span>日</span><span>-10</span><span>月</span><span>20</span><span>日。</span></span></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><b><span>5.</span></b><b><span>推免录取</span></b></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><span>我院将通过“推免服务系统”向复试合格的申请人发放待录取通知，考生须网上确认“同意待录取”才能完成录取过程，未在规定时间内确认“同意待录取”的，视为自动放弃待录取资格，我院将不再保留其拟录取资格。</span></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><b><span>6.</span></b><b><span>名单公示</span></b></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><span><span>我院推免生（含直博生）拟录取名单将在一院官网和研招网公示，公示时间不少于</span><span>7</span><span>日。</span></span></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><span>四、联系方式</span></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><b><span>1.</span></b><b><span>火箭院研究生招生办公室联系方式</span></b></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><span>联系人：黄老师 </span></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><span><span>联系电话：</span><span>010-68198919</span></span></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><span><span>电子邮箱：</span><span>ht@calt.com.cn</span></span></p>\n<span> </span>\n<p><b><span>2.</span></b><b><span>各培养单位联系方式</span></b></p>\n<div>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<td> <p><b><span>培养单位</span></b></p> </td>\n<td> <p><b><span>联系方式</span></b></p> </td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td> <p><b><span>研究发展中心（一院）</span></b></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span>联 系 人：郑老师</span></p> <p><span>联系电话：<span>010-68198673</span></span></p> <p><span>电子邮箱：<span>yfzhaosheng@calt.com.cn</span></span></p> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td> <p><b><span>战术军贸事业部（一院）</span></b></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span>联 系 人：陆老师</span></p> <p><span>联系电话：<span>010-68384194</span></span></p> <p><span>电子邮箱：<span>zswq516@163.com</span></span></p> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td> <p><b><span>物资中心（一院）</span></b></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span>联 系 人：刘老师</span></p> <p><span>联系电话：<span>010-68381547</span></span></p> <p><span>电子邮箱：<span>wzzxhr@calt.com.cn</span></span></p> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td> <p><b><span>总体设计部（一院）</span></b></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span>联 系 人：黎老师</span></p> <p><span>联系电话：<span>010-68751723</span></span></p> <p><span>电子邮箱：<span>caltzhaopin_01@163.com</span></span></p> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td> <p><b><span>10</span></b><b><span>所（一院）</span></b></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span>联 系 人：马老师<span>                            </span></span></p> <p><span>联系电话：<span>010-88522954                </span></span></p> <p><span>电子邮箱：</span><span><a href=\"mailto:hr_10s@163.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>hr_10s@163.com</span></a></span></p> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td> <p><b><span>12</span></b><b><span>所（一院）</span></b></p> </td>\n<td> <p><span>联 系 人：靳老师<span>         </span></span></p> <p><span>联系电话：<span>010-88527579     </span></span></p> <p><span>电子邮箱</span><span>：<span>yjs_12s@126.com </span></span></p> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td> <p><b><span>14</span></b><b><span>所（一院）